T*
(Delta_T_cold = 0 - 25 = -25 deg C) Tj
T*
(V_oc_cold = 49.8 * [1 + \(-0.0028 * -25\)] = 49.8 * [1 + 0.07] = 49.8 * 1.07 = 53.29 V) Tj
T*
