T*
(1. Power Consumption Calculations:) Tj
T*
(- Motor electrical input power at 100% load: P_100 = 90 kW / 0.92 = 97.83 kW.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Method A \(Mechanical Throttling\):) Tj
T*
(- At 100% flow \(3,200 h\): E_100 = 97.83 kW * 3,200 h = 313,056 kWh.) Tj
T*
(- At 70% flow throttled \(4,800 h\): Power is 86% of full load = 0.86 * 97.83 = 84.13 kW.) Tj
T*
